# 10. SITEMAP IMPLEMENTATION

Prefer a maintainable Laravel implementation.

Do not create a manually hard-coded XML file if the application contains dynamic public content that should eventually be represented.

A reasonable architecture is:

```text
GET /sitemap.xml
        ↓
Laravel route/controller
        ↓
Generate XML
        ↓
Public indexable URLs
```

If a static sitemap is more appropriate for the current small site, document the reasoning.

Do not introduce an unnecessary sitemap package.

