# 15. ROBOTS.TXT

Implement:

```text
https://smevolve.tech/robots.txt
```

The production robots file should allow search engines to crawl public pages.

Example architecture:

```text
User-agent: *
Allow: /

Disallow: /admin/
Disallow: /api/
Disallow: /storage/
Disallow: /vendor/
Disallow: /password/
Disallow: /reset-password/

Sitemap: https://smevolve.tech/sitemap.xml
```

Adjust the actual rules to match the application's routes.

Do NOT block public CSS, JavaScript, images, or other assets required for rendering.

---

# 16. ADMIN PROTECTION

The admin portal must not be intended for search indexing.

Use both:

